        "message": "GSAP tween on \"#zoom-body\" uses motion that snaps to integer device pixels: fontSize. Layout and text-reflow properties snap during browser layout; roundProps rounds the tween value. Slow motion or an ease-out tail then stutters under the seek-by-frame capture engine. Animate transforms (x/y/scale/opacity) instead.",
