          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "width": 0,
          "height": 0
        },
        "time": 0,
        "fixHint": "do not animate fontSize (they reflow text and snap glyph positions): replace fontSize with scale (same visual, no reflow). Transforms interpolate sub-pixel and stay smooth at any speed."
